Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:25:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 36/43] Metal diamond engine: dispersive materials three
 components of a cell at a time (snapshot cg30j)

The Pre, Post and Apply stages of the Drude/Lorentz, conducting-sheet and Debye elements go over cells instead of
cell components: coefficients and state are groups of three floats stored as float4, the offsets count groups, and
one pass does a float3 of each. The same operations per component in the same order. The GCPW line ran 3 % faster
(paired rounds, loaded machine). diamond_check.sh 72 of 72 identical, the sheet, Drude/Lorentz and Debye cases
among them.

Generated-by: Claude Fable 5.2 (Anthropic)
Signed-off-by: Angel Martinez <110217098+anmartinez1256@users.noreply.github.com>
